-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Nov  6 21:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of Dillo 3.3.0
  * Build against FLTK 1.3 (FLTK 1.4 support is still experimental
    upstream and not recommended for distribution packages)
  * TLS via OpenSSL, using the openSUSE CA bundle
  * Point DILLO_DOCDIR to /usr/share/doc/packages/dillo so the Help button finds
    the local user_help.html
  * Enable PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP, SVG, brotli, IPv6 and the dilloc
    control socket
